  "notes": [
    "Rows are organized by asset; columns are N,E,S,W.",
    "Altar, wall, character and prop art is based on code-drawn test-center.js graphics.",
    "Furnishings and doors rotate their original top-down artwork; upright objects (flames, crystal, pillars and statues) keep their vertical posture. Characters have minimal cardinal facing views, with no walking animations.",
    "Wall corner/T/end/cross pieces are additional matching-color concepts for future connectivity tools. They are not in the current editor.",
    "Floor tiles are visually identical in each orientation, since rotating a floor is not necessary."
  ]
